enefit &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: sans-serif; font-size: 14px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;{!$Record.Beneficiary__r.FirstName}&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: sans-serif; font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: sans-serif; font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;In the next few days, the Master Pooled Trust will prepare your Toolkit and send it to you via FedEx or USPS. A digital version may be found&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;{!ToolkitLink}&quot; rel=&quot;noopener noreferrer&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; style=&quot;font-family: sans-serif; font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: sans-serif; font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;. The Toolkit explains how the Trust works and includes everything you need to manage the account. Please keep it in an easy-to-find place and refer to it often. Your Toolkit will also include a copy of the executed Joinder Agreement and Trust Document, which officially establish the account. Be sure to store these documents in a safe place.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;font-family: sans-serif; font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;u&gt;*Before any disbursements can be made, you must review the Toolkit and return the attached Acknowledgement of Policies Form (Form A).*&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px; font-family: sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Please feel free to call us at 1-800-252-9729 or 512-454-6694 or email&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;mailto:info@arcare.org&quot; rel=&quot;noopener noreferrer&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 14px; font-family: sans-serif; color: rgb(11, 92, 171);&quot;&gt;info@arcare.org&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px; font-family: sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;with any questions you may have. The Arc of Texas looks forward to working with you!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px; font-family: sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Sincerely,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px; font-family: sans-serif;&quot;&gt;MASTER POOLED TRUST&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px; font-family: sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Haley Greer&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px; font-family: sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Master Pooled Trust Director&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;{!AccountSignupLink}&quot; rel=&quot;noopener noreferrer&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; style=&quot;font-family: sans-serif; font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;﻿Click here to sign up for online access&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px; font-family: sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Please allow 3-5 business days after signing up to gain online access to the account&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</text>
